{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UxmyFmw8K_3X_rSougMw3g","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:37.723226+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UxmyFmw8K_3X_rSougMw3g","html":"<div><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>中国科学院大学国际理论物理中心（亚太地区）2026推荐免试研究生报名通道已开启。报名截止时间</span></span><span><span>2025年9月15日24:00，想报名的同学请抓紧时间哦~</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>01</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请要求</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span> 申请条件</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、</span><span>在申请人所在学校获得当年推荐免试资格，并在教育部中国研究生招生信息网“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（以下简称“教育部推免服务系统”）中获得母校推荐免试资格名单备案。</span></p><p><span>2、</span><span>热爱科学事业，有较好的科研潜力，道德品质良好，遵纪守法。</span></p><p><span>3、</span><span>诚实守信，品行端正，学风优良，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录，无任何违法违纪受处分记录。</span></p><p><span>4、</span><span>在大学本科阶段学习成绩优异，在学期间专业主干课程无补考记录。</span></p><p><span>5、</span><span>通过大学英语四级及以上（含四级），具有较强的外国语听、说、读、写应用能力。</span></p><p><span>6、</span><span>具有较强的调查研究、综合分析问题、解决问题能力。</span></p><p><span>7、</span><span>身体健康状况符合规定的体检标准，心理健康状况良好。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span> 申请材料 </span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、</span><span>《中国科学院大学接收推荐免试研究生申请表》</span></p><p><span>2、</span><span>所在学校教务部门（或院系）出具并加盖公章的大学本科前三年所修课程成绩单（ 五年制的提供前四年课程成绩单）</span></p><p><span>3、</span><span>有效居民身份证复印件</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>4、</span><span>1封副教授及以上老师推荐信</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>5、其他获奖证明材料，可包括：获奖证书、专利证书复印件，发表或未发表的、能体现自身学术水平的学术论文等。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><em><span><span>注：如有特殊情况无法按时提交推荐信，可先提交报名，在报名截止后一周内将推荐信发送至我中心张老师邮箱（zhang-min@ucas.ac.cn）。</span></span></em></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>02</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>报名方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请者请于</span><span><strong><span>2025年9月15日前</span></strong></span><span>进入申请链接完成相关注册并上传申请材料。</span></p><p><span>申请链接：</span></p><p><span>https://ictp-ap.org/form/108#/</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span>请将申请材料按顺序扫描合并为一个PDF文件上传至附件（文件大小最好不超过20M），文件命名为：“姓名+所在学校”。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>具体通知请点击链接“</span><span>https://ictp-ap.org/post/236</span><span>”，至我中心官网查看。</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"fc36005d3648004b5bc3e22ba6b6fe1c9b0b1fbd640eaea458218d5602951b6f","textLength":805,"sourceSha256":"05f3abc99d9a27afb1fb97c268ca689364182a12bf6b1e676e433cb0efdb04a2","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5fa8e760c59b7a968c22","title":"2025年中国科学院大学国际理论物理中心（亚太地区）2026年接收推荐免试研究生招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:37.723226+00:00"}
